ms and a variety of compilations including a remix album and a live album recorded in Las Vegas, USA. His collaborations with artists [a120848], [a232956], [a630180], [a2358866], [a1407415], [a381876] and [a1771801]; amongst many others; has kept his name on the charts. He also catapulted new group formations such as [a4407177] and [a4407699].\r\n\r\nIn 2009, he married his long time manager [a4395740] and soon thereafter had their first daughter. ","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:119538","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":[{"active":false,"id":4407303,"name":"Grupo Manía"}],"members":null,"namevariations":["Crespo","Crespo Elvis","E. Crespo","E.Crespo","Elvis","Elvis Crespo Díaz","Elvis Crispo","Exito De Elvis Crespo","艾維斯"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/119538-Elvis-Crespo","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.instagram.com/elviscrespolive/","http://elviscrespolive.com/tatuaje/site/","https://twitter.com/elviscrespolive"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/1967265/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"1967265","image":"https://i.discogs.com/n9zfo_aqyg9Zfh4ozIGnX23HrT5TQomnxBzF3at26_Y/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:500/w:500/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE5Njcy/NjUtMTY5MTAzNDA3/OC0zMzM5LnBuZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/hpONjGEcdp6YLfqMZqYKn8dH1FH0_x96Ltq8b3_maXs/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE5Njcy/NjUtMTY5MTAzNDA3/OC0zMzM5LnBuZw.jpeg","profile":"Thebe Neruda Kgositsile (born February 24, 1994), better known by his stage name Earl Sweatshirt, is an American rapper and record producer from Los Angeles, California. Kgositsile was originally known by the moniker Sly Tendencies when he started rapping, but soon changed his name when Tyler, the Creator invited him to join his alternative hip hop collective Odd Future in late 2009.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1967265","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":2247560,"name":"Thebe Kgositsile"},{"id":3381772,"name":"random